{"5145370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The apartment case", "steam_appid": 5145370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Malaysian culture and folklore, the game follows Lim Ming, a supernatural investigator tasked with uncovering whether the apartment hotel is truly haunted and the evil within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5145370/extras/7f1718de748ed53fe2825d0ed1b44352.poster.avif?t=1788056512\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5145370/extras/7f1718de748ed53fe2825d0ed1b44352.webm?t=1788056512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5145370/extras/7f1718de748ed53fe2825d0ed1b44352.mp4?t=1788056512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the apartment hotel through 2D side-scrolling exploration. Talk to the inhabitants, help them, and uncover the truth hidden within the building. But be careful—some may offer you help, while others may lead you into danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INVESTIGATION</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5145370/extras/4614a2ab4036f204f66e6b392103a331.poster.avif?t=1788056512\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5145370/extras/4614a2ab4036f204f66e6b392103a331.webm?t=1788056512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5145370/extras/4614a2ab4036f204f66e6b392103a331.mp4?t=1788056512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every nook and cranny to uncover clues behind the haunting. Use your torchlight to reveal supernatural signs, examine your surroundings, and read through files and documents to uncover what happened in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAOISM EXOCISM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5145370/extras/a87d32c0e8d05367db5fb0cbb26285f0.poster.avif?t=1788056512\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5145370/extras/a87d32c0e8d05367db5fb0cbb26285f0.webm?t=1788056512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5145370/extras/a87d32c0e8d05367db5fb0cbb26285f0.mp4?t=1788056512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter malicious spirits that seek to take your life. Use Taoist tools to exorcise them while staying alert to their presence. Spirits can approach from any direction—use the <i>Luopan</i> to sense the nearest approaching spirit and locate where it is coming from before it strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Malaysian culture and folklore, the game follows Lim Ming, a supernatural investigator tasked with uncovering whether the apartment hotel is truly haunted and the evil within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\